(7522997, 1201824, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes well to the challenge.<br/> <br/>Great composition Marcel, well captured. The diagonal is what makes this work so well and filling the frame as you have it fulfils the brief completely. I like the reflections on the underside of the plane it adds an intriguing touch to the end result. Everything is in good sharp focus, all in all an excellent result both in score and position well done Marcel.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes well to the challenge. Great composition Marcel, well captured. The diagonal is what makes this work so well and filling the frame as you have it fulfils the brief completely. I like the reflections on the underside of the plane it adds an intriguing touch to the end result. Everything is in good sharp focus, all in all an excellent result both in score and position well done Marcel.', '2017-07-12 07:35:47.000000', NULL, 0),
